To convert grams to milligrams, multiply by 1000 because 1 gram (g) is equal to 1000 milligrams (mg).  

\[
1 \text{ gram} = 1000 \text{ milligrams}
\]  

Thus, the equivalent of 1 gram in milligrams is $\boxed{1000 \text{ mg}}$.

