3. Polymerization method: Choose the appropriate polymerization method for the desired polymer structure and properties. There are various polymerization methods, such as free radical, chain-growth, and condensation polymerization, each with its own advantages and disadvantages. Choosing the right method can help to improve the efficiency and yield of the process.

