   = 1920 + 66 + 12 + 1/4096
   \]
   \[
   = 1999 + 1/4096
   \]

5. **Final Answer:**
   \[
   \boxed{1.99925}
   \]

   The probability of getting at least 9 of 12 favorable outcomes is approximately 1.999",relevance,"# Task Description
